  "name": "Egnyte",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Search, manage, and extract intelligence from Egnyte enterprise content. Connects Claude Code to your Egnyte domain via the Egnyte MCP server and CLI, enabling file operations, hybrid search, AI document Q&A, knowledge base queries, and collaboration tools.",
